msgstr "确认订单时，把订单行上修改过的单价与折扣写回该订单供应商的价格表，使下一张采购订单默认带出这些价格。"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_purchase/models/purchase_order.py:0
msgid "%(order)s updated the vendor price of %(vendor)s from %(old_price)s to %(new_price)s %(currency)s (discount %(old_discount)s%% -> %(new_discount)s%%)."
msgstr "%(order)s 已将 %(vendor)s 的供应商价格由 %(old_price)s 更新为 %(new_price)s %(currency)s（折扣 %(old_discount)s%% → %(new_discount)s%%）。"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_purchase/models/purchase_order.py:0
msgid "%(order)s: the vendor pricelist was not updated for %(product)s, the taxes of the order line differ from the vendor taxes of the product."
msgstr "%(order)s：未更新 %(product)s 的供应商价格表，订单行的税与产品的供应商税不一致。"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_purchase.field_purchase_order__sn_missing_receipt
msgid "Missing Receipt"
msgstr "缺收货"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_purchase.field_purchase_order__sn_missing_receipt
msgid "Set when the order is confirmed, a quantity is still expected from the vendor and every receipt of the order is already done or cancelled. Only then is the missing receipt not reachable from the standard flow."
msgstr "当订单已确认、仍有数量待向供应商收取，且订单下的收货单全部已完成或已取消时置位。只有这种情况才无法从标准流程进入收货。"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sn_wsd_purchase.purchase_order_form_missing_receipt
msgid "Receive Remaining"
msgstr "补收货"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_purchase/models/purchase_order.py:0
msgid "Receipt"
msgstr "收货单"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_purchase/models/purchase_order.py:0
msgid "A missing receipt can only be created on a confirmed purchase order."
msgstr "只有已确认的采购订单才能补建收货单。"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_purchase/models/purchase_order.py:0
msgid "There is no quantity left to receive on this purchase order."
msgstr "该采购订单没有待收数量。"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_purchase/models/purchase_order.py:0
msgid "No receipt was created: the order lines must hold a storable product with a quantity left to receive."
msgstr "未生成收货单：订单行必须是可库存的产品，且仍有待收数量。"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_purchase.field_purchase_order_line__stocked_qty
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_purchase.field_purchase_request_line__stocked_qty
msgid "Stocked Quantity"
msgstr "入库数量"

#. module: sn_wsd_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_purchase.field_purchase_order_line__stocked_qty
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_purchase.field_purchase_request_line__stocked_qty
msgid "Quantity that has completed the storage step of the reception."
msgstr "已完成来料上架入库环节的数量。"
